==Enemy==
The Shakurel variant of [[Doge]]. About as easy as one, requiring barely anything to defeat.

==Strategy==
Treat this enemy as you would a [[Doge]], spam [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] to easily defeat it.

